--- !u!114 &420783847
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 420783844}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  fate: 0
  answerSeconds: 0
  ghostName: Tomas
  nodes:
  - line: That mark can reach places I can't. Take me to Vane. I only want the truth.
    choices:
    - text: Do you remember your family?
      reply: 'Tomas: My mother''s name... I can''t. Or her face. There was a song...|Tomas:
        But I remember the knife. And the names.'
      next: 1
      karma: 1
      fate: 0
    - text: Why can Elias see you?
      reply: 'Tomas: He got me this job. The living see the dead they share guilt
        with. He couldn''t look away.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: Did you tell him to kill?
      reply: 'Tomas: I showed him who signed. What else should he have done?'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
  - line: Vane paid Harlow to make my body disappear. He filed a fall and collected
      your signatures.
    choices:
    - text: I need proof.
      reply: 'Tomas: Collection. KEEP COLD. The manifest bears his code. Then his
        ledger and the tape.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: What happens at the bridge?
      reply: 'Tomas: Only confessed souls can cross. Vane thinks he can force his
        way through.|Tomas: Take me close enough to him. I''ll make sure he answers.'
