  jumpTime: 1.1
  dropHeight: 28
  pushLine: ...footsteps. Right behind me.
  leapLine: The stairs just... stop.|No. No no no-- JUMP!
  landLine: Agh... my leg... I can't feel my leg...
  rifleLine: A rifle. Security's.
  jumpLine: 'Vane: NOWHERE TO RUN, DRIVER!'
  fightLine: 
  gunLine: Elias's rifle. Maya took it from the landing.
  defeatedLine: 'He drops to his knees, blood running down his face.|Elias: Go on.
    Finish it. You people are good at that.'
  keysLine: My car keys. He had them the whole time.
  kingLine: 
  floodLine: The grates... that's blood. It's filling up.|SWIM!
