--- !u!114 &1118213934
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1118213931}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  fate: 0
  answerSeconds: 0
  ghostName: Nadia
  nodes:
  - line: He had every name. I heard him say, 'Tomas, which room?'
    choices:
    - text: Where are my keys?
      reply: 'Nadia: You put them through the slot at seven. Elias arrived here after
        the fall. He went to your desk and took them.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: When did he come?
      reply: 'Nadia: Half past five, carrying a rifle. Maya and Sam ran into Silo
        2. Vane fled down the service tunnel.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: I'm sorry.
      reply: 'Nadia: I signed too. I want to remember who I was before that.'
      next: 1
      karma: 1
      fate: 0
  - line: Vane locked himself in his office. It didn't save him.
    choices:
    - text: How do I get in there?
      reply: 'Nadia: The keypad by his door. Ask Ben about the date.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: Did anyone make it out?
      reply: 'Nadia: Maya and Sam ran for Silo 2. They still had their bodies when
        they went.|Nadia: Please. Get them out.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
      fate: 0
    - text: Serves Vane right.
      reply: 'Nadia: ...he was scared. We all were. You too.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
      fate: 0
  afterLine: 'Nadia: Maya and Sam. Silo 2. Get them out.'
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
