--- !u!114 &2126111257
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2126111254}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 65f27eeb84e620841b41716250897d8e, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GhostNPC
  fate: 0
  answerSeconds: 0
  ghostName: Priya
  nodes:
  - line: He came at half past five. Tomas's brother. By quarter past six, we were
      all dead.
    choices:
    - text: Why are you blue?
      reply: 'Priya: I''m forgetting myself. The more I hide from what I did, the
        less of me there is. We''re the Lost.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: Where is Vane?
      reply: 'Priya: Hiding in the Echo. We can''t enter without a mark. Touch the
        threshold in reception.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: I'll help if I can.
      reply: 'Priya: Thank you. Find what happened. Don''t just sign another story.'
      next: 1
      karma: 1
      fate: 0
    - text: Why am I still solid?
      reply: 'Priya: Your mark holds your identity. Elias has his purpose. The Damned
        have their excuses.|Priya: Truly confess, and the shape can change back.
        Say the words while still blaming someone else, and nothing is mended.'
      next: 1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
  - line: Elias pulled the fuses when he came for us. He wanted us to die in the
      dark.
    choices:
    - text: Where did he hide them?
      reply: 'Priya: He hid them where we used to be. The cake we bought Tomas. Derek''s
        desk. By the bodies at the back.'
      next: -1
      karma: 0
      fate: 0
    - text: I'm sorry this happened to you.
      reply: 'Priya: ...thank you. Nobody ever said that.|Priya: Tomas''s cake. Derek''s
        desk. The bodies at the back. Go.'
      next: -1
      karma: 1
      fate: 0
    - text: I don't care. I just want my keys.
      reply: 'Priya: That''s what you said about Tomas too.|Priya: Find the fuses
        yourself.'
      next: -1
      karma: -1
      fate: 0
  afterLine: 'Priya: The fuses. Tomas''s cake, Derek''s desk, the bodies at the back.
    Hurry.'
  onFinished:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
